      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for sharing. \nThis change is requested by our internal team from Lindar\u0027s lesson learnt as b:188855362.\nIn our internal mail thread, our power confirm taeko\u0027s MB is allowed to support 60W(20V3A) adapter, but our thermal team still needs next phase\u0027s MB to verify thermal cooling. \nTo avoid impacting our factory as Lindar\u0027s experience, internal team ask to follow Lindar\u0027s change. Thermal\u0027s problem should be able to fix by tuning DPTF once our thermal team confirm it.\nSo, I limit adapter rating by define PD_MAX_POWER as 45W.",
